 (2128)].\"},{\"summary\":\"Partial recrystallization can generate mixed grain structures and non-uniform α\",\"explanation\":\"Partial recrystallization lies between recovery and recrystallization; it can occur during delays or holding and may lead to a mixed grain structure [Data: Entities (222); Relationships (300)]. Deformation can be given in the partial recrystallization region, and uniform grain structure requires successive reductions per pass greater than that for partial recrystallization [Data: Entities (420); Relationships (826)]. Mixed α-grain structure is a non-uniform α-grain structure that can form from partial recrystallization during holding and deteriorates toughness [Data: Entities (272); Relationships (489, 746)].\"}]}", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "annotations": null, "audio": null, "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null, "reasoning_content": "We need answer only JSON object per schema. Need craft report. We have entities/relationships from metallurgy controlled rolling community. Need title, summary, findings 5-10, rating, rating_explanation. Grounding references datasets: Entities, Relationships. Need not invent. We need comprehensive but under 1000 words. Need use record ids. Let's parse data. This is technical domain, not threat. Impact severity rating? It's about importance of community. Could rate maybe 4.0? The schema just says rating float. We can choose moderate. Need explain.\n\nNeed produce JSON only. Let's develop findings.\n\nKey community: controlled rolling / recrystallization in Nb steels, gamma/alpha grain refinement. Central entities: RECRYSTALLIZATION (degree 80), Γ (29), Α (29), FERRITE (23), DEFORMATION BANDS (22), Γ-GRAIN (19), PARTIAL RECRYSTALLIZATION (18), HIGH TEMPERATURES (18), HOT ROLLING (16), Γ-REGION (15), TYPE 2 (15), etc. Relationships connect recrystallization to α-grain size, γ-region, hot-strip mill, addition Nb, P_S/R_g, holding, etc.\n\nNeed findings:\n1. Recrystallization central mechanism: en